{# The calling-convention section, shared by every engine template that feeds #}
{# the calling-convention readings. Parameterized by (findings list, heading #}
{# text) so each template passes its own heading text. The body is #}
{# verbatim-pinned by the section suite in src/lib.rs — wording or formatting #}
{# drift fails CI. #}
{# The seam capability records (#357 fan-out): one admission line per #}
{# family this section feeds — the engine facets behind it, as the capability #}
{# probe answers them — quoted from the held seam report. Each rides exactly #}
{# one "Analysis engine:" line, after the coverage line, beside the entries; #}
{# when the section filed nothing at all the line rides under the heading, #}
{# the heading opening for the first line that needs it. An answerable or #}
{# undeclared family renders exactly what it rendered before. #}
{% macro calling_convention_section(findings, heading, coverage, decompilation_cap, disassembly_cap, caller_edges_cap) %}
{% if !findings.is_empty() %}
## {{ heading }}

The calling conventions detected for this function and its callees by
static analysis — mangled-name letters, `@N` import decorations, callee
epilogues, caller stack cleanup, and the x64 call shape. Spell extern
declarations and any stack cleanup with the detected convention instead
of assuming `__stdcall`, and do not invent stack cleanup for a convention
that leaves none:

{% for finding in findings %}
- **{{ finding.convention|safe }}** {% if finding.callee.is_some() %}for `{{ finding.callee.as_ref().unwrap() }}` {% endif %}(via {{ finding.method }}, confidence {{ finding.confidence }})
  Evidence: `{{ finding.evidence|safe }}`
{% endfor %}

{% endif %}
{% if !coverage.admission.is_empty() %}
{% if findings.is_empty() %}
## {{ heading }}

{% endif %}
Coverage: {{ coverage.admission }}

{% endif %}
{% if !decompilation_cap.is_empty() %}
{% if findings.is_empty() %}
{% if coverage.admission.is_empty() %}
## {{ heading }}

{% endif %}
{% endif %}
Analysis engine: {{ decompilation_cap }}

{% endif %}
{% if !disassembly_cap.is_empty() %}
{% if findings.is_empty() %}
{% if coverage.admission.is_empty() %}
{% if decompilation_cap.is_empty() %}
## {{ heading }}

{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
Analysis engine: {{ disassembly_cap }}

{% endif %}
{% if !caller_edges_cap.is_empty() %}
{% if findings.is_empty() %}
{% if coverage.admission.is_empty() %}
{% if decompilation_cap.is_empty() %}
{% if disassembly_cap.is_empty() %}
## {{ heading }}

{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
Analysis engine: {{ caller_edges_cap }}

{% endif %}
{% endmacro %}